            "review_title": "Review at Danang, Temple",
            "review_text": "SpringZephyr\nSingapore283 contributions\n0\nProfessional Service\nDec 2018 • Family\nWe were exploring places to eat near our hotel, and were limited to looking for places which serves food that my family (2 boys and my wife) could eat as they are allergic to seafood. Yes, at Danang beach - not the best place to have this allergy!\n\nWe found options at Temple. The service was good. The staff were comprehensive and alert. The food was fine except for my wife's snowfish which was a little overdone.\n\nThere is a nice beach in front, well lit up. We went down to the beach after dinner and walked back to our hotel via the beach.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 19, 2018",
